  "text": "1\n00:00:10,783 --> 00:00:11,683\nMira: Good morning, Hana!\n\n2\n00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:14,420\nHana: Morning, Mira! You are early today.\n\n3\n00:00:18,683 --> 00:00:21,683\nMira: I could not sleep. Could I get a latte, please?\n\n4\n00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:24,740\nHana: Of course. One latte, coming right up.\n\n5\n00:00:53,517 --> 00:00:55,017\nMira: Thank you. It smells wonderful.\n\n6\n00:00:55,433 --> 00:00:57,753\nHana: Fresh beans this morning. Enjoy it.\n\n7\n00:01:07,917 --> 00:01:10,017\nMira: How long have you had this place?\n\n8\n00:01:10,433 --> 00:01:13,713\nHana: Five years this spring. Feels like longer some days.\n\n9\n00:01:24,583 --> 00:01:26,683\nMira: Do you ever get a day off?\n\n10\n00:01:27,100 --> 00:01:29,100\nHana: Sundays, if the machine behaves.\n\n11\n00:01:42,917 --> 00:01:45,017\nMira: I should get going. See you tomorrow!\n\n12\n00:01:45,433 --> 00:01:48,073\nHana: See you tomorrow, Mira. Good luck today!\n"
 },
